  "notes": "USAGE:\nOften used in publishing, education, and presentations. {図解|ずかい}する means to illustrate or explain with diagrams. Very common in book titles, especially for introductory or reference works.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {図解|ずかい}つき (with illustrations; illustrated)\n- {図解|ずかい}で{説明|せつめい}する (to explain with diagrams)\n- {図解|ずかい}{入門|にゅうもん} (illustrated introduction — common book title format)\n- {図解|ずかい}{事典|じてん} (illustrated encyclopedia)",
